{"id":"dawn-far-off","name":"Dawn Far Off","type":"Machine Gun","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/4529cda72f9df5ae560d67f5ec85c2ed.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/1484294659.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Magazine","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Extended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/66cfea124e24e73cca1ce6370b44ca7e.png","desc":"This weapon has a greatly increased magazine size, but reloads much slower.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Alloy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Appended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9f468cce26fe35d9db413e2f8451127.png","desc":"This weapon's magazine is built for higher capacity.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Burning Ambition","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f7a2484668486f64020a612bd3dd5ab9.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage scorches the target. Dealing damage to a scorched target inflicts scorch."},{"name":"Light Touch","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/46b000a4e8c4ffa73df16c26a63360e0.png","desc":"This weapon gains reload speed, handling, and aim down sight speed when you are amplified, radiant, or have Devour."},{"name":"Subsistence","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa8f4295a71bf47df7ffd8599f7af4d.png","desc":"Defeating targets partially reloads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Triple Tap","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0795f44c0c3611b15428742c67918cd1.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return one round to the magazine."},{"name":"Collective Demolition","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/47894c30f18dabf52f84aa514b63b5ea.png","desc":"Collecting an Elemental pickup or destroying a Tangle grants this weapon a stacking period of grenade energy generation on hit. Throwing a Tangle provides additional time.\n\nElemental pickups include [Solar]Firesprites, [Void]Void Breaches, [Arc]Ionic Traces, [Stasis]Stasis Shards, and [Strand]Strand Tangles."},{"name":"Impromptu Ammunition","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/27f988cc5d7e9f8e48479b0519f831a0.png","desc":"Final blows increase ammo meter progress from all sources for a short time."},{"name":"Attrition Orbs","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c2092fae6ae58ca77a7f9b4434e688ef.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage creates an Orb of Power."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Incandescent","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/22ed4a2cd5a0eb129a14ce77db49373f.png","desc":"Defeating a target spreads scorch to those nearby.\nMore powerful combatants and opposing Guardians cause scorch in a larger radius."},{"name":"Killing Tally","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a64f5d3e972ea35b1789f62999235083.png","desc":"Kills increase this weapon's damage until it is stowed or reloaded."},{"name":"Aggregate Charge","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/35b9761aa61c2180059b9ba349c04dcf.png","desc":"This weapon deals more damage for each elemental debuff applied to the target."},{"name":"Target Lock","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/72be46e05195a95ae1307a684f68456b.png","desc":"Damage increases the longer this weapon remains on a target."},{"name":"Binary Orbit","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1efa3bc1f9622f08f7d2461f2fb080f9.png","desc":"Elemental final blows opposite this weapon increase damage for a short duration. Darkness final blows boost Arc, Solar, and Void weapons. Light final blows boost Stasis, Strand, and Kinetic weapons."},{"name":"Redirection","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/062243c2875d9bbdc29aa115e1e299c5.png","desc":"Damaging rank-and-file combatants increases damage against more powerful ones."},{"name":"Meganeura","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b5378713f840558b0641deb21bbe6c08.png","desc":"Precision final blows create an elemental damage explosion that deals more damage based on the number of rapid precision hits dealt beforehand."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Dream Work","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/31849bc5f040430f9c03416121188286.png","desc":"Once per reload, assists or assisted final blows partially refill the weapon from reserves and increase reload speed for a short duration. Bows receive faster draw time."}]}],"notes":["Constructed by @Adamsdown_Boy (PvE PvE-Boss PvE-SustainedDamage PvE-EndGame PvE-God M+KB Controller): First-choice PvE roll for sustained DPS in a damage phase against a single yellow-bar target in activities rated Normal, Hard or Very Hard difficulty. Dawn Far Off is an aggressive LMG, which are rated B-Tier for endgame PvE by @TheAegisRelic Endgame Analysis Spreadsheet​, who says \"best balance of DPS and total amongst LMGs, stagger intrinsic good\". The frame intrinsic offers built in Anti-Unstoppable, but no other benefit as per the Destiny Data Compendium. The recoil direction is just right of vertical and quite tight, so you could improve recoil control or look to boost Stability to help hit crits, or just boost Handling if you can land your shots. In the magazine perk slot, perks that improve mag size or Reload Speed work best for a boss damage roll. For sustained damage, in the first trait perk column Triple Tap generates one ammo from thin air for hitting three crits within 3s of each other, effectively adding ~50% to your total ammo if you can keep hitting crits. In the second column for damage Aggregate Charge provides a stack for each different elemental debuff up to ×3 stacks to boost damage by ×1.33, with each stack lasting as long as the debuff is active, Killing Tally gains a stack for each enemy killed up to ×3 to boost damage by up to ×1.3 until you reload or stow, or Target Lock stacks up to 5 times on repeated hits within 0.2s of each other for up to ×1.4 damage at 110.33% of base magazine capacity - so works well combined with Triple Tap and the origin trait. Aegis ranks the Dream Work origin trait as B-Tier - in a fireteam it can, once per reload, refill 66% of your magazine which can overflow it on killing an enemy that was already damaged by an ally. Recommended MW: Handling, with your preferred choice of mod to boost weapon stats, ammo generation, or elemental pickups for builds.","Constructed by @Adamsdown_Boy (PvE PvE-Utility PvE-EndGame PvE-God M+KB Controller): First-choice PvE utility roll for solar Warlocks running Eunoia or Dawn Chorus in activities rated Normal, Hard or Very Hard difficulty. Dawn Far Off is an aggressive LMG, which are rated B-Tier for endgame PvE by @TheAegisRelic Endgame Analysis Spreadsheet​, who says \"best balance of DPS and total amongst LMGs, stagger intrinsic good\". The frame intrinsic offers built in Anti-Unstoppable, but no other benefit as per the Destiny Data Compendium. The recoil direction is just right of vertical and quite tight, so you could improve recoil control or look to boost Stability to help hit crits, or just boost Handling if you can land your shots. In the magazine perk slot, any of the combat effect mags, or perks that improve Reload Speed or mag size are fine. For weapon-based application and progression of scorch into ignitions, you can roll both solar damage perk traits - Incandescent spreads +30 Solar Scorch stacks within 4m on a red bar Minor add kill (+45 stacks within 8m for orange and yellow bars), with scorch damage counting as weapon damage so can inherit damage boosts, and also proc subclass fragments, while Burning Ambition works better to build Solar ignitions on tougher targets if you have a solar ability like a Eunoia Helion to apply scorch initially, otherwise it'll take 27 hits within 2s of each other to apply +20 scorch stacks with +20 added on each additional hit to build towards an ignition. All of the scorch stacks are increased by ×1.5 with Ember of Ashes, and Dawn Chorus provides ×3 Scorch damage. Aegis ranks the Dream Work origin trait as B-Tier - in a fireteam it can, once per reload, refill 66% of your magazine which can overflow it on killing an enemy that was already damaged by an ally. Recommended MW: Handling, with your preferred choice of mod to boost weapon stats, ammo generation, or elemental pickups for builds.","Constructed by @Adamsdown_Boy (PvE PvE-Minor PvE-SingleAdd PvE-EndGame PvE-God M+KB Controller): First-choice PvE roll for clearing individual Minor adds or tougher enemies in activities rated Normal, Hard or Very Hard difficulty. Dawn Far Off is an aggressive LMG, which are rated B-Tier for endgame PvE by @TheAegisRelic Endgame Analysis Spreadsheet​, who says \"best balance of DPS and total amongst LMGs, stagger intrinsic good\". The frame intrinsic offers built in Anti-Unstoppable, but no other benefit as per the Destiny Data Compendium. The recoil direction is just right of vertical and quite tight, so you could improve recoil control or look to boost Stability to help hit crits, or just boost Handling if you can land your shots. In the magazine perk slot, any of the combat effect mags, or perks that improve Reload Speed or mag size are fine. For clearing Minor adds, in the first trait perk column, Subsistence reloads 20% of the magazine on kills, so you'll never have to worry about reloads, or Light Touch boosts Handling and Reload Speed, and provides an ADS scalar while you're Amplified or Radiant, or Devour is active. Alternatively, Attrition Orbs spawns a power orb after 33 hits within 5s of each other to proc armour mods. In the second column for damage Killing Tally gains a stack for each enemy killed up to ×3 to boost damage by up to ×1.3 until you reload or stow, or Aggregate Charge provides a stack for each different elemental debuff up to ×3 stacks to boost damage by max ×1.33, with each stack lasting as long as the debuff is active. Aegis ranks the Dream Work origin trait as B-Tier - in a fireteam it can, once per reload, refill 66% of your magazine which can overflow it on killing an enemy that was already damaged by an ally. Recommended MW: Handling, with your preferred choice of mod to boost weapon stats, ammo generation, or elemental pickups for builds.","Constructed by @Adamsdown_Boy (PvE PvE-Minor PvE-GroupAdd PvE-EndGame PvE-God M+KB Controller): First-choice PvE roll for clearing groups of Minor adds in activities rated Normal, Hard or Very Hard difficulty. Dawn Far Off is an aggressive LMG, which are rated B-Tier for endgame PvE by @TheAegisRelic Endgame Analysis Spreadsheet​, who says \"best balance of DPS and total amongst LMGs, stagger intrinsic good\". The frame intrinsic offers built in Anti-Unstoppable, but no other benefit as per the Destiny Data Compendium. The recoil direction is just right of vertical and quite tight, so you could improve recoil control or look to boost Stability to help hit crits, or just boost Handling if you can land your shots. In the magazine perk slot, any of the combat effect mags, or perks that improve Reload Speed or mag size are fine. For clearing Minor add groups, in the first trait perk column, Subsistence reloads 20% of the magazine on kills, so you'll never have to worry about reloads, or Light Touch boosts Handling and Reload Speed, and provides an ADS scalar while you're Amplified or Radiant, or Devour is active. Alternatively, Attrition Orbs spawns a power orb after 33 hits within 5s of each other to proc armour mods. In the second column for damage Incandescent spreads +30 Solar Scorch stacks within 4m on a red bar Minor add kill (+45 stacks within 8m for orange and yellow bars). On Solar subclasses, all of the scorch stacks are increased by ×1.5 with Ember of Ashes. Or there's Meganeura builds up to ×3 stacks on crit hits for a refreshable 4s for solar AoE explosive damage in a 7.5m radius on a crit kill. Incandescent scorch kills and Meganeura explosion kills are treated as weapon damage so inherit damage boosts and also proc subclass fragments and weapon traits like Subsistence and Attrition Orbs' orb generation. Aegis ranks the Dream Work origin trait as B-Tier - in a fireteam it can, once per reload, refill 66% of your magazine which can overflow it on killing an enemy that was already damaged by an ally. Recommended MW: Handling, with your preferred choice of mod to boost weapon stats, ammo generation, or elemental pickups for builds."],"estimated":null,"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[0,11,26,31],[0,11,26,32],[0,11,26,33],[0,12,23,30],[0,12,24,30],[0,12,24,31],[0,12,24,32],[0,12,24,36],[0,12,25,30],[0,12,25,31],[0,12,25,32],[0,12,25,36],[0,12,26,31],[0,12,26,32],[0,12,26,33],[0,12,29,30],[0,12,29,31],[0,12,29,32],[0,12,29,36],[0,13,23,30],[0,13,24,30],[0,13,24,31],[0,13,24,32],[0,13,24,36],[0,13,25,30],[0,13,25,31],[0,13,25,32],[0,13,25,36],[0,13,26,31],[0,13,26,32],[0,13,26,33],[0,13,29,30],[0,13,29,31],[0,13,29,32],[0,13,29,36],[0,14,23,30],[0,14,24,30],[0,14,24,31],[0,14,24,32],[0,14,24,36],[0,14,25,30],[0,14,25,31],[0,14,25,32],[0,14,25,36],[0,14,29,30],[0,14,29,31],[0,14,29,32],[0,14,29,36],[0,15,23,30],[0,15,24,30],[0,15,24,31],[0,15,24,32],[0,15,24,36],[0,15,25,30],[0,15,25,31],[0,15,25,32],[0,15,25,36],[0,15,29,30],[0,15,29,31],[0,15,29,32],[0,15,29,36],[0,16,23,30],[0,16,24,30],[0,16,24,31],[0,16,24,32],[0,16,24,36],[0,16,25,30],[0,16,25,31],[0,16,25,32],[0,16,25,36],[0,16,29,30],[0,16,29,31],[0,16,29,32],[0,16,29,36],[0,17,23,30],[0,17,24,30],[0,17,24,31],[0,17,24,32],[0,17,24,36],[0,17,25,30],[0,17,25,31],[0,17,25,32],[0,17,25,36],[0,17,26,31],[0,17,26,32],[0,17,26,33],[0,17,29,30],[0,17,29,31],[0,17,29,32],[0,17,29,36],[0,18,23,30],[0,18,24,30],[0,18,24,31],[0,18,24,32],[0,18,24,36],[0,18,25,30],[0,18,25,31],[0,18,25,32],[0,18,25,36],[0,18,26,31],[0,18,26,32],[0,18,26,33],[0,18